1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,617
A bill begins as an idea. A member of Congress drafts it and introduces it in one chamber.

2
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:12,389
Committees hold hearings and vote. Then the full chamber debates and votes.

3
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:20,781
If both chambers pass the same text, the president may sign or veto it.

